{"id":"encantador","lemma":"encantador","pos":"adj","rank":1536,"glosses":["charming, captivating, enchanting, lovely","delightful, lovely","winsome"],"ipa":"/enkantaˈdoɾ/","forms":{"feminine":"encantadora","masculinePlural":"encantadores","femininePlural":"encantadoras"},"order":1591,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-encantador.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ella era una mujer encantadora.","en":"She was a charming woman.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/34792","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"woman"},null]},{"text":"Puedes ser realmente encantador cuando quieres.","en":"You can be pretty charming when you want to be.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609667","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"really"},null,{"g":"when"},{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"}]},{"text":"Su abuela es una dama encantadora.","en":"Your grandmother is a charming lady.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/915742","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"grandmother"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"lady, dame"},null]}]}